    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "Here $n=8149$, $x_{3}=\\text{prb}[0.00012]=-3.70$, and $x_{4}=\\text{prb}[0.99705]=+2.74$. Applying Equation 11.12a, the estimated width of the developmental map for class 4 is",
